<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Engine symbol table for the macOS build of the game.

  The Windows build locates engine functions with byte patterns (BG3Extender/GameHooks/BinaryMappings.xml)
  because bg3.exe has no symbols. The macOS game binary keeps its full symbol table, so each entry here
  simply names the Mach-O symbol that a StaticSymbols member (GameDefinitions/Symbols.h) is bound to.

  An entry belongs here only once the symbol has been checked against the game binary: it exists, and for
  functions the calling convention matches the *Proc type the extender declares (arm64: `this` in x0,
  non-trivial return values through x8). Symbols that exist under a matching name but with a different
  signature are listed at the bottom and deliberately left unbound.

  Checked against game version 4.1.1.7631656. Verify with macOS/scripts/check-symbols.py after a game update.
-->
